# Quarto academic website starter

This is a starter personal website for an academic statistics lecturer.

## Files to edit first

1.  `_quarto.yml` — site title, links and navigation.
2.  `index.qmd` — biography, research summary and contact links.
3.  `research.qmd` — research themes and projects.
4.  `teaching.qmd` — teaching experience and resources.
5.  `publications.qmd` — selected publications.
6.  `cv.qmd` — short CV page.
7.  `styles.css` — colours and appearance.

Place `profile.jpg` and `cv.pdf` in this same folder if you want the profile image and CV download link to work.

## Preview locally

From this folder, run:

``` bash
quarto preview
```

## Render the site

``` bash
quarto render
```

The finished website will be placed in the `docs` folder.
